tel 1.0 propensive.dev/bolt

# Bolt codes of LIRA: `subdivision 1` / `error 8` is ↯/a.1.8, which the LIRA
# Specification formerly called L108. Subdivision 1 is the validity rules the
# specifications in the `lira` repository define, common to every
# implementation; the subdivisions after it are the modules of the `lira`
# implementation, in the order of their dependencies.
#
# This is the record of the letter `a` which the index of bolt codes, `projects.tel` in
# propensive/bolt, names; its schema is `bolt.tel` there. A code, once assigned, is permanent:
# a number is never reused, and one which is withdrawn stays, marked `retired`.

project a lira

  subdivision 1 specification
    summary  validity rules of the LIRA Specification and its companions (LIRA Specification §2)
    error 1 invalid-manifest
      summary  The manifest does not decode as one BinTEL document conforming to the `lira` schema
      source  spec/lira.md §5.1
    error 2 payload-length
      summary  The decompressed payload is not exactly its declared length
      source  spec/lira.md §8.1
    error 3 invalid-blob-stream
      summary  The blob stream is not well-formed
      source  spec/lira.md §8.2
    error 4 missing-blob
      summary  A referenced blob is absent from the payload
      source  spec/lira.md §8.2
    error 5 payload-hash
      summary  The payload hash is not its declared value
      source  spec/lira.md §8.4
    error 6 invalid-tree
      summary  A tree metadata blob is not valid
      source  spec/lira.md §9.2
    error 7 overlay-not-minimal
      summary  An overlay is not minimal
      source  spec/lira.md §9.3
    error 8 api-divergence
      summary  The sections of a release do not present one API
      source  spec/lira.md §9.6
    error 9 lineage-mismatch
      summary  The last lineage entry is not the release's own snapshot
      source  spec/lira.md §12.2
    error 10 ungraded-successor
      summary  A successor is not a patch or minor step over its predecessor, and no major was requested
      source  spec/lira.md §12.3
    error 11 duplicate-module
      summary  A buildpath holds more than one release of a module
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 12 namespace-clash
      summary  Two releases of a buildpath claim clashing namespaces
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 13 absent-dependency
      summary  A module named by a dependency is absent from the buildpath
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 14 unsatisfiable
      summary  No release of a module satisfies a requirement on it
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 15 bad-directive
      summary  A file does not begin with the fixed eight-byte header
      source  spec/lira.md §5.1
    error 16 sigil-specified
      summary  The manifest ends at or before the end of the file, carrying no payload
      source  spec/lira.md §5.1
    error 17 version-required
      summary  A published release carries no version, or one with major 0
      source  spec/lira.md §12.5
    error 18 build-pinned
      summary  A dependency is pinned to a build
      source  spec/lira.md §12.5
    error 19 unpublished-dependency
      summary  A required snapshot appears in no published lineage
      source  spec/lira.md §12.5
    error 20 version-projection
      summary  The version is not the projection of the lineage
      source  spec/lira.md §12.5
    error 21 bad-signature
      summary  A signature does not verify
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 22 unknown-algorithm
      summary  A signature's algorithm is not implemented by the verifier
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 23 unknown-key
      summary  A signature's key fingerprint matches no trusted key
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 24 bad-resource
      summary  Resource declarations are ill-formed
      source  spec/lira.md §11.4
    error 25 ineffective-resource
      summary  A declared resource resolves to nothing, or to content another discipline claims
      source  spec/lira.md §11.4
    error 26 resource-clash
      summary  Two modules export or track overlapping resource paths
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 27 inapplicable-discipline
      summary  A declared discipline atomizes no universe the release carries
      source  spec/lira.md §9.6
    error 28 profile-violated
      summary  A declared ecosystem profile is violated
      source  spec/lira.md §11.6
    error 29 profile-weakens
      summary  A profile weakens a core requirement
      source  spec/lira.md §11.6
    error 30 unrecorded-break
      summary  A step does not preserve a guarantee level which a profile does not record
      source  spec/lira.md §12.4
    error 31 bad-integration
      summary  The integrations of a release are ill-formed
      source  spec/lira.md §9.5
    error 32 no-assignment
      summary  No integration of a module is satisfiable on the buildpath
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 33 unrealized-integration
      summary  A declared integration has no section
      source  spec/lira.md §9.5
    error 34
      summary  Content is not claimed in the claiming order
      source  spec/lira.md §11.2
    error 35 bad-host-contract
      summary  A host contract is ill-formed
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 36 unsatisfied-requirement
      summary  No given host contract satisfies a requirement
      source  spec/lira.md §13.3
    error 37 not-host-contract
      summary  A requirement names a module whose releases are not host contracts
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 38 bad-derivative
      summary  A declared derivative hash does not recompute
      source  spec/lira.md §13.6
    error 39 malformed-payload
      summary  The payload is not a well-formed Brotli stream
      source  spec/lira.md §8.1
    error 40 unimplemented-claim
      summary  A declared discipline or profile has no implementation to check it
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 41 atoms-mismatch
      summary  A declared atom listing does not recompute from the content
      source  spec/lira.md §16
    error 42 tag-reassigned
      summary  A tag names a different release of the module
      source  spec/lira.md §12.6
    error 43
      summary  An `app` section does not have the shape its kind admits
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 44
      summary  Content of an `app` or `env` section which no discipline claims is not claimed atomless
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 45
      summary  An environment is not valid
      source  spec/lira.md §13.7
    error 46
      summary  A transition of an environment leaves it, or a rolling deployment's intermediate state, invalid
      source  spec/lira.md §13.7
    error 47
      summary  An environment is named as a dependency
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 48
      summary  An `env` section does not have the shape its kind admits
      source  spec/lira.md §9.4
    error 49
      summary  Two binding addresses are equal, or one is a path-prefix of the other
      source  spec/lira.md §13.7
    error 50
      summary  A requirement is not satisfied by every concurrently-serving release of its provider
      source  spec/lira.md §13.7
    error 51
      summary  An increment file's prefix, manifest or header is not valid, or it carries no body
      source  spec/increment.md §3
    error 52
      summary  An increment does not apply to its base
      source  spec/increment.md §7
    error 53
      summary  An increment's command stream is not well-formed
      source  spec/increment.md §5
    error 54
      summary  An increment's priming prefix is not the one its header's parameters fix
      source  spec/increment.md §6
    error 55
      summary  The blob stream an increment reconstructs does not verify
      source  spec/increment.md §7
    error 56
      summary  An increment is given an identity
      source  spec/increment.md §8

  subdivision 2 format
    error 1 discipline
      symbol Discipline.Error
      summary  A discipline could not atomize the content it claimed
      source src/format/lira.Discipline.scala
      variant 1 malformed
      variant 2 duplicate
      variant 3 unresolved
      variant 4 nondeterminism

  subdivision 3 derive

  subdivision 4 bundle

  subdivision 5 classfile

  subdivision 6 foreign

  subdivision 7 tasty

  subdivision 8 core
    error 1 delta-error
      summary  A delta file did not parse, named an absent base, or did not reconstruct its release
      source src/core/lira.DeltaFile.scala
    error 2 store-error
      summary  A store object failed re-verification, or an operation addressed an absent object
      source src/core/lira.Store.scala

  subdivision 9 launcher

  subdivision 10 tool
